{
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's ridiculous to think you can beat me!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So frustrating."
            ]
        }
    },
    "3": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Thanks for the report.",
                "You tanukis can rest now."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Just as I thought. It appears there are some no-good people",
                "running around here and there."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I want to find that notorious Toutetsu",
                "as soon as possible."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ahahaha."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who would've thought Sanae was into that kind of stuff?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What're you mumbling about all to yourself?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I heard a voice whispering in my ear,",
                "so I've been trying to listen to it."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And it's been so much fun!"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Whispering?",
                "Lemme have a look."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, you're in big trouble.",
                "Inside your hair..."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What?",
                "The tanuki in front of me is an enemy?"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Okay, I'll take her out!"
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's a fox in your hair!",
                "It's a tube-fox!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "4": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A tube-fox...",
                "That's another pain in the neck."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Once you're possessed, it's all over.",
                "They'll manipulate you until you're a goner."
            ]
        }
    },
    "5": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You want me to leave right now?",
                "Got it!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "6": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Is the tube-fox Tsukasa here?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I hear you've been receiving blessings from",
                "the Moriya Shrine lately."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My, my."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Miss Chief bake-danuki!",
                "How can I help you today?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You speak as though this is your home."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let me be frank with you. Your tube-foxes have been",
                "working a lot here. Don't you think it's too much?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Do understand that Gensokyo is ",
                "not your private estate."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh? You, who has her bake-danuki running ",
                "wild all over, see fit to lecture me?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Humph. You low-class beast.",
                "Don't talk down to me like that."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Low class is fine,",
                "you wretched beast!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "7": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Tanuki and foxes...",
                "Are us masters of the same tricks bound to clash?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why don't we call a truce here?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'd be happy to do so, but..."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You want information, don't you?",
                "Heheheh..."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm already tracking the movement of Kicchou of",
                "the Kiketsu Family and Kurokoma of the Keiga Family."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ha, their information leaks like a venting pipe.",
                "I already know that."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But what about Toutetsu of the Gouyoku Alliance?",
                "She is the most notorious one."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll trade her information for a truce,",
                "if you find it acceptable, of course..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "8": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Tanuki and foxes...",
                "Us masters of the same tricks are bound to clash, aren't we?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "9": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Tsukasa was afraid of Toutetsu and avoided her.",
                "She has a cute side to her too."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's see, \"Toutetsu will soon appear",
                "at the Children's Limbo,\" they said."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "As expected of a tube-fox.",
                "She has an impressive information network."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who's there?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, the bake-danuki chief."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Speak of the devil."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What do you want from me?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You want ownership of the land, don't you?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But with one rival after another,",
                "gathering new allies in a hurry..."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Get to the point."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why don't you team up with me, ",
                "someone who knows everything about the surface?"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ha, sure. I don't mind."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh?"
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However, I don't need weak people."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Understand?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's enough, right?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah, you're now part of ",
                "the Gouyoku Alliance."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was sure you would refuse.",
                "My plans have been thrown off."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You must have been in a hurry because ",
                "the other beasts are getting new allies."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You've got the wrong idea."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I recently made a new ally before you."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even before Yachie and Saki."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No reason to turn down somebody",
                "who wants to be an ally."
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A new ally...",
                "You've made your arrangement, I see."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You won, you won!",
                "I surrender!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've miscalculated.",
                "Toutetsu already has an ally."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My plan was to pretend to be friends ",
                "with Toutetsu and spy on her."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A slight change of strategy is necessary."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Talking to yourself in the graveyard."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "As expected of a gal approved by Toutetsu,",
                "you have excellent hobbies."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm Chiyari Tenkajin.",
                "What about you?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's Mamizou.",
                "I'm running a staffing agency on the surface."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "They said the Gouyoku Alliance had a new ally.",
                "Is that you?"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Indeed."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmmm, what is Toutetsu thinking?"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Bringing in somebody who's so",
                "obviously a spy..."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What do you say?",
                "Miss Mamizou Futatsuiwa, the bake-danuki!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "13": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You have a sharp mind."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I reckon I have seen you somewhere,",
                "aren't you that chupacabra youkai?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Chupa... cabra?",
                "No, I'm a tenkajin..."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't worry, the chupacabra is very popular on",
                "the surface. Be proud of yourself."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And what's with the test tube on your leg?",
                "Whose blood is in that?"
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oi, don't touch that without my permission!"
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What is this?",
                "This... Youkai scent..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "14": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I wonder if Toutetsu really wanted to triumph in this conflict."
            ]
        }
    },
    "15": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...Damn."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Getting caught in a teleportation trap is not like me."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I think I somehow managed to escape midway.",
                "Where is this place?"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Welcome to Hell!"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No matter who, no matter when,",
                "they are all welcome in Hell."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who are you?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My name's Hisami Yomotsu,",
                "the guide of Hell."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hell?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A trap to <i$Hell>!?",
                "How does the like of a chupacabra have something so vile?"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now, where would you like to go today?"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't care, I've fallen into",
                "a trap, I'm leaving right now!"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh my, are you not aware?"
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Once you're in Hell, ",
                "you can't get out by yourself!"
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Come now, let me guide you",
                "to the very depths of Hell!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "16": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's useless.",
                "Because Hell is..."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Not the kind of place you can leave on your own, right?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll have to find someone with the authority ",
                "to get me out of here."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That is correct. As such, I'll take you",
                "to the one who has the authority to do so."
            ]
        }
    },
    "17": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And now I'll guide you as I promised."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Straight. To. Hell."
            ]
        }
    },
    "18": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hell is the same no matter where you go."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nothing at all.",
                "Seriously, nothing at all."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Finally, you have arrived."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You, who came all the way from the province of Sado.",
                "Welcome."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And who are you?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My name is Zanmu Nippaku."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "To think anyone could free themselves from",
                "a teleportation trap after it has sprung...."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you get on the wrong train,",
                "don't you just jump out the window? Normally."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What? Well, I don't get what you're talking about,",
                "but nobody would do that."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyway, your selfish actions are a hindrance to me."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So I had you brought to hell."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hindered you?",
                "Are you with the Kiketsu Family or the Keiga Family?"
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heh heh."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You would lump me with those beasts?",
                "You lack judgement."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I am my own alliance,",
                "the one who uses nothingness to quell this incident."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now, shut up and witness."
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The dear and amusing people who dance in the palm of my hand."
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The world proceeds as I planned."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How pitiful."
            ]
        }
    }
}